<h1> Frequently asked questions</h1>

<h2>What are your opening times?</h2>
<p>We are open every day, from 9am to 6pm. Last entry is at 5pm.</p>

<h2>How long does a visit take?</h2>
<p>Usually most families spend around two to three hours with us.</p>

<h2>Is the aquarium suitable for young children?</h2>
<p>Very much so. Our Coastal Rockpools zone is designed to be hands-on for younger visitors, and pushchairs are welcome throughout the building.</p>

<h2>Can I touch the animals?</h2>
<p>Only in our supervised Touoch Pool, where our team will show you how to interact gently and safely.</p>

